<title>JAPAN: Japan end-Sept oil product stocks.</title>
<headline>Japan end-Sept oil product stocks.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Friday issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-September.</p>
<p>		(1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p>Gasoline	1,910	 12,014    + 1.3    - 6.8</p>
<p>Naphtha	 1,762	 11,083    - 7.0    +10.3</p>
<p>Jet Fuel	  805	  5,063    +26.2    -13.6</p>
<p>Kerosene	4,762	 29,953    +13.8    + 8.7</p>
<p>Gas Oil	 2,686	 16,895    + 2.3    +19.8</p>
<p>Fuel Oil A    1,801	 11,328    - 3.9    + 4.8</p>
<p>Fuel Oil C    2,062	 12,970    - 5.1    + 1.6</p>
</text>
